<p>Your affinity for the shadows grow stronger.</p><p>Whenever one of your spells deal darkness damage you have a 20% chance to gain 8% to all damage affinity for 8 turns.</p><p>If you kill a creature with darkness damage this effect always triggers.</p><p>You can only gain one stack of Dark Reign per turn.</p><p>This effect stacks multiplicatively up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> times.</p>